        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.0625rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Content Refresh Strategy</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Older pages losing rankings usually need an update, not a rewrite from scratch. Identifying what changed, competitor content, search intent, outdated facts, keeps existing pages earning traffic.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Protects the traffic you've already earned</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bento-grid bento-grid-3" id="seo-panel-local" data-seo-tab-panel="local" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="seo-tab-local" hidden>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-box"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#006875; font-size:24px;">location_on</span></div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.0625rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Google Business Profile Management</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Hours, categories, and photos need to stay current across every location a business operates, a manual task that gets skipped once a business has more than a couple of branches.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Often the deciding factor in "near me" search results</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-box"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#006875; font-size:24px;">map</span></div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.0625rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Location Page Optimization</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">A UAE business serving multiple emirates needs a genuinely useful page for each area it serves, not a template with the city name swapped, which search engines and users both notice.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Directly relevant for UAE businesses covering several emirates</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-box"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#006875; font-size:24px;">reviews</span></div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.0625rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Citation &amp; Review Consistency</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Inconsistent business name, address, or phone number across directories confuses both search engines and customers. Monitoring keeps listings aligned and flags new reviews to respond to.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Builds the trust signals local rankings depend on</p>
      </div>
    </div>
